1
00:00:01,429 --> 00:00:03,540
GVERET RIVKA POZMENTER

2
00:00:02,607 --> 00:00:03,276
ye

3
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:06,721
mit ayer erloybenish geyen mir foroys mit undzer intervyu.

4
00:00:06,721 --> 00:00:09,303
mir haltn yetst bay kasete numer fir.

5
00:00:09,563 --> 00:00:11,531
zayt azoy gut dertseylt mir

6
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,467
ayer iberlebenishn.

7
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,796
⟨vi vi⟩ v- iz geven in BERLIN

8
00:00:17,612 --> 00:00:19,413
un in BERLIN hot men

9
00:00:19,413 --> 00:00:22,550
hot men zi- di SCHLACHTENSEE ⟨un in⟩ SCHLACHTENSEE

10
00:00:22,573 --> 00:00:24,551
bin ikh gevor gevorn

11
00:00:24,551 --> 00:00:27,022
az kh'hob a shvoger in FELDAFING

12
00:00:27,248 --> 00:00:29,959
hob ikh geshtrebt tsu forn nokh FELDAFING

13
00:00:30,032 --> 00:00:31,376
tsu shvoger

14
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:44,403
un me hot gezukht meydn, demolt iz nisht geven laykht tsu forn.

15
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,059
⟨hot⟩ bin ikh nokh gevezn ⟨in onheyb⟩ zaynen ⟨mir⟩ nokh geven

16
00:00:50,059 --> 00:00:51,761
⟨ka-⟩ in KASTEL

17
00:00:52,054 --> 00:00:54,883
dort iz geven a lager oykhet

18
00:00:55,463 --> 00:00:56,959
un

19
00:00:57,285 --> 00:01:01,137
kh'veys nisht, kh'gedenk nisht vi lang ⟨bin ikh⟩ geven in dem lager in

20
00:01:01,137 --> 00:01:04,536
SCHLACHTENSEE. a por monatn zenen mir gevezn, yeder hot zikh

21
00:01:04,536 --> 00:01:07,646
ayngeordnt. ikh bin, ikh hob genumen,

22
00:01:07,646 --> 00:01:09,260
m'hot gezogt ver

23
00:01:09,368 --> 00:01:12,518
s'hot epes a fakh zol arbetn ⟨in⟩ zayn fakh.

24
00:01:12,518 --> 00:01:14,376
ikh hob keyn fakh nisht gehat,

25
00:01:14,376 --> 00:01:16,701
azoy vi ikh hob gehat di tsvey kinder

26
00:01:16,701 --> 00:01:19,495
hob ikh gezogt "ikh vil zikh farnemen mit di kinder".

27
00:01:19,495 --> 00:01:23,874
zenen, zenen demolt gekumen fun Rusland zenen geven etlekhe mishpokhes

28
00:01:23,998 --> 00:01:28,381
zog ikh "ikh vel zikh farnemen mit di kinder, ikh vel ⟨akht⟩ UNK oyf di kinder"

29
00:01:28,381 --> 00:01:31,293
mit esn, zen ven zey geyn in di shul arayn.

30
00:01:31,293 --> 00:01:35,838
s'iz geven a, s'hot zikh bald gemoldn a lererin vos iz gekumen fun Rusland.

31
00:01:35,862 --> 00:01:38,524
zi hot gelernt mit di kinder

32
00:01:38,524 --> 00:01:41,113
hob ikh gezogt "ikh vel UNK bay esn,

33
00:01:41,113 --> 00:01:43,297
ikh vel UNK bay ontuen".

34
00:01:43,725 --> 00:01:46,499
s'iz geven kinder on eltern, s'iz geven kinder

35
00:01:46,499 --> 00:01:50,317
vos hobn UNK ⟨gehat⟩ un s'iz geven kinder vos hobn keynem mer nisht gehat

36
00:01:50,610 --> 00:01:55,076
hob ikh zikh farnumen mit di kinder un azoy hot gedoyert a por monatn

37
00:01:55,352 --> 00:01:56,578
biz kh'bin,

38
00:01:56,871 --> 00:02:00,527
bin, me hot ongehoybn aroystsuforn fun dem lager.

39
00:02:00,651 --> 00:02:06,720
un ikh bin geforn nokh FELDAFING, ikh kh'veys nisht ⟨vi⟩ UNK ikh bin ⟨geforn⟩, natirlekh ⟨avade⟩ mit di banen

40
00:02:06,895 --> 00:02:09,133
biz m'iz gekumen nokh FELDAFING.

41
00:02:09,342 --> 00:02:10,871
un in FELDAFING

42
00:02:11,518 --> 00:02:13,317
bin ikh geven

43
00:02:12,919 --> 00:02:14,938
dos iz shoyn geven a D.P. lager.

44
00:02:14,657 --> 00:02:15,768
yo,

45
00:02:15,768 --> 00:02:18,198
FELDAFING iz shoyn gevezn a

46
00:02:18,198 --> 00:02:19,776
a lager vos me hot ge-

47
00:02:19,776 --> 00:02:21,249
me hot gegebn

48
00:02:22,150 --> 00:02:23,511
far

49
00:02:23,888 --> 00:02:25,434
me hot gegebn

50
00:02:25,609 --> 00:02:29,028
ales, di kinder ⟨hobn⟩ ongehoybn tsu geyn in di shul

51
00:02:30,199 --> 00:02:31,340
mayne.

52
00:02:33,726 --> 00:02:35,292
un ikh bin

53
00:02:35,292 --> 00:02:37,221
geven di baleboste in di shtub.

54
00:02:37,221 --> 00:02:38,900
ikh hob nisht geganen tsu di arbet,

55
00:02:38,991 --> 00:02:41,803
tsu bislekh hob ikh ongehoybn epes dort

56
00:02:41,961 --> 00:02:46,143
yo meyn ikh, ikh, mayne shvester, ikh hob gehat shvester in Amerike,

57
00:02:46,143 --> 00:02:48,471
un ⟨brider⟩, zenen zey gevor gevorn

58
00:02:48,471 --> 00:02:51,556
un zey hobn mir oykh geshikt peklekh fun Amerike.

59
00:02:52,002 --> 00:02:54,240
un m'hot gehat tsu lebn.

60
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:56,889
m'hot gehat tsu lebn. keyn gelt hot men dokh nisht gehat,

61
00:02:57,098 --> 00:02:58,695
me hot gehat tsu esn.

62
00:02:59,106 --> 00:03:01,850
un azoy hot gedoyert a por monatn.

63
00:03:02,498 --> 00:03:05,158
hob ikh gezogt "kh'hob nisht ⟨genug⟩, kh'vil

64
00:03:05,164 --> 00:03:07,050
vegn vegn ir forn"

65
00:03:07,050 --> 00:03:09,039
⟨dos kh'bin⟩ geforn UNK nokh Poyln.

66
00:03:07,408 --> 00:03:09,022
di shvester's kinder

67
00:03:09,045 --> 00:03:11,632
yo, ⟨kh'vel dokh⟩ nisht iberlozn di kinder.

68
00:03:11,632 --> 00:03:16,484
zikh di di ⟨yingele⟩ hob ikh dokh nisht gevust UNK ⟨vu er iz⟩, zi hob ikh gevust vu zi iz.

69
00:03:16,484 --> 00:03:18,844
ober ⟨er, me hot⟩ nisht gevust ⟨vu⟩ zi iz.

70
00:03:19,660 --> 00:03:22,387
vos UNK hobn mikh mentshn opgeredt.

71
00:03:23,018 --> 00:03:26,944
haynt nokh Poyln tsu forn, s'iz geven zeyer nisht gut tsu forn nokh Poyln.

72
00:03:27,287 --> 00:03:31,249
ober s'iz nokh geven in Poyln in Daytshland iz geven

73
00:03:31,249 --> 00:03:34,537
geblibene, di Polyakn vos zenen geven oyf arbet,

74
00:03:34,611 --> 00:03:37,946
hobn zey gehat dos rekht tsu forn, es hot gornisht gekost.

75
00:03:39,285 --> 00:03:42,100
⟨hob⟩, dos hot geheyst di repartiantn.

76
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:43,860
hob ikh zikh demolt oykh

77
00:03:43,860 --> 00:03:46,243
ayngegebn als repartiantin

78
00:03:46,243 --> 00:03:49,964
un als repartrantkin bin ikh geforn azoy ⟨az s'hot mikh⟩ gornisht gekost

79
00:03:49,964 --> 00:03:51,103
az kh'bin a

80
00:03:51,103 --> 00:03:53,911
a poylishe, ikh bin geven do oyf arbet,

81
00:03:53,911 --> 00:03:55,835
yetst for ikh aheym,

82
00:03:55,835 --> 00:03:58,314
hot dokh gornisht gekost, ikh bin geforn.

83
00:03:58,506 --> 00:04:00,424
bin ikh geforn nokh Poyln.

84
00:04:00,582 --> 00:04:05,498
vegn ikh hob di kinder iber⟨UNK⟩ bay mayn shvoger. mayn shvoger hot dort khasene gehat, di ershte froy

85
00:04:05,498 --> 00:04:07,404
iz geven mayn man's shvester

86
00:04:07,404 --> 00:04:09,767
iz zi geshtor- iz zi geharge-

87
00:04:09,767 --> 00:04:12,759
geblibn bay Hitlern, umgekumen.

88
00:04:10,403 --> 00:04:11,679
umgekumen

89
00:04:13,238 --> 00:04:15,480
iz zi, hot er dort geheyrat

90
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:16,911
mit a tsveyte froy

91
00:04:17,220 --> 00:04:20,727
un UNK un ikh hob UNK ⟨ibergelozt⟩ di kinder bay zey

92
00:04:20,727 --> 00:04:26,397
un eyn tokhter iz geven, di yingere iz geven krank oykhet, zi hot gelitn oyf di oyern

93
00:04:26,397 --> 00:04:28,790
nokh der milkhome geferlekh gelitn

94
00:04:28,932 --> 00:04:30,367
ober zi hot zikh kurirt.

95
00:04:30,367 --> 00:04:32,740
me hot zi kurirt, me hot zi genumen in shpitol arayn.

96
00:04:34,551 --> 00:04:38,354
ikh bin geforn, bin ikh take, bin ikh tsugeforn nokh Poyln.

97
00:04:38,719 --> 00:04:41,447
dos iz shoyn geven in zeks un fertsikstn?

98
00:04:39,056 --> 00:04:39,556
⟨in a⟩

99
00:04:41,253 --> 00:04:44,316
dos iz geven ⟨in⟩ zeks un fertsikstn UNK ⟨zayn⟩

100
00:04:43,191 --> 00:04:44,349
yo

101
00:04:44,316 --> 00:04:47,538
oder anfang zibn un fertsik oder zeks un fertsik ⟨kimat⟩

102
00:04:48,135 --> 00:04:51,296
kh'vey- nisht vi lang s'hot gedoyert, ⟨azoy⟩ lang ⟨vi⟩ ikh bin geven

103
00:04:51,296 --> 00:04:53,327
fun Daytshland ⟨biz⟩ UNK

104
00:04:53,569 --> 00:04:55,588
ikh hob gemuzt zayn azoy

105
00:04:55,588 --> 00:04:58,068
ende, ende zeks un fertsik ⟨efsher⟩

106
00:04:56,556 --> 00:04:58,136
ende zeks un fertsik

107
00:04:58,125 --> 00:04:59,793
zeks un fertsik, yo.

108
00:05:01,652 --> 00:05:05,088
un dos iz geven, bin ikh ⟨dokh⟩ geforn nokh Poyln.

109
00:05:05,668 --> 00:05:07,096
un

110
00:05:07,255 --> 00:05:08,475
kh'hob gezukht,

111
00:05:08,475 --> 00:05:09,881
kh'hob zey gefunen.

112
00:05:10,191 --> 00:05:12,328
ikh bin dort ahingekumen

113
00:05:12,638 --> 00:05:15,526
ikh ho', aleynt, ikh bin shoyn nisht geganen aleyn.

114
00:05:15,526 --> 00:05:17,731
demolt bin ikh shoyn nisht geganen aleyn.

115
00:05:17,731 --> 00:05:20,461
kh'bin gekumen in a shtetl arayn vu s'iz gevezn

116
00:05:20,873 --> 00:05:23,542
tsvey oder dray yidn zenen dort gevezn

117
00:05:23,542 --> 00:05:26,874
eyner a geviser ⟨SARKOVITSHER⟩ lebt shoyn nisht

118
00:05:27,538 --> 00:05:31,565
un nokh der ⟨SARKOVITSH⟩ iz geven zeyer a heldisher man

119
00:05:31,605 --> 00:05:35,728
un er hot zikh farnumen mit azolkhe zakhn.

120
00:05:35,728 --> 00:05:37,995
er hot getun azolkhe zakhn.

121
00:05:38,558 --> 00:05:41,589
s'oystsugefinen, oystsurateven yidishe kinder

122
00:05:40,476 --> 00:05:41,668
oystsuge- yo

123
00:05:41,668 --> 00:05:44,739
un ikh nokh aheymforndik fun Daytshland

124
00:05:44,739 --> 00:05:46,972
hob ikh ⟨nokh⟩ opgetretn

125
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:49,827
me hot mir gezogt s'iz do in Varshe

126
00:05:49,827 --> 00:05:51,343
rav KAHANA.

127
00:05:51,973 --> 00:05:54,231
efsher hot ir gehert fun rav KAHANA.

128
00:05:54,231 --> 00:05:59,257
er iz geven a g- a general in poylishe militer.

129
00:06:00,428 --> 00:06:01,868
hot men gezogt,

130
00:06:01,868 --> 00:06:03,881
az er kon mir helfn.

131
00:06:05,170 --> 00:06:07,440
avade hob ikh dos gevor gevorn in Daytshland,

132
00:06:07,440 --> 00:06:10,178
kh'veys nisht genoy ⟨vi⟩ UNK. yo, un nokh a zakh,

133
00:06:10,178 --> 00:06:12,464
ikh bin nokh opgetretn in a

134
00:06:12,464 --> 00:06:16,133
in a kinder-lager vu me hot kinder genumen in a lager arayn

135
00:06:16,341 --> 00:06:18,360
vi hot gehey-? SZCZECIN.

136
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,558
efsher hot ir, neyn,

137
00:06:19,598 --> 00:06:21,516
s'hot nisht geheysn SZCZECIN.

138
00:06:19,632 --> 00:06:20,959
ZAKOPANE?

139
00:06:21,589 --> 00:06:24,317
neyn, dos iz gevezn in UNK

140
00:06:24,745 --> 00:06:26,730
in, lebn Kroke.

141
00:06:27,778 --> 00:06:29,457
hob ikh dort opgetretn,

142
00:06:29,457 --> 00:06:31,689
vayl me hot gezogt az dortn iz do a yingl,

143
00:06:32,153 --> 00:06:33,619
vos er iz geven

144
00:06:33,619 --> 00:06:36,309
tsuzamen ⟨a molt⟩ mit mayn tokhter bay a goye.

145
00:06:36,309 --> 00:06:40,359
zog ikh az ikh vel dos yingl dort trefn, vel ikh nemen nokh Daytshland.

146
00:06:40,359 --> 00:06:42,401
ikh bin gekumen dort ahin,

147
00:06:42,401 --> 00:06:45,798
vi hot geheysn di shtot? lebn Kroke

148
00:06:44,843 --> 00:06:45,849
Velitshke?

149
00:06:45,940 --> 00:06:46,775
vi?

150
00:06:46,345 --> 00:06:47,773
Velitshke efsher?

151
00:06:47,635 --> 00:06:51,806
s'iz nisht Velitshke, s'iz nisht Velitshke. ⟨vey, vey⟩ shpeter dermon ikh mikh.

152
00:06:48,953 --> 00:06:49,443
neyn?

153
00:06:51,998 --> 00:06:55,063
bin ikh dort arayn in dem lager arayn

154
00:06:55,727 --> 00:06:57,006
un

155
00:06:57,006 --> 00:06:59,627
a tog befor hot ⟨zi⟩ aroysgefirt di kinder.

156
00:06:59,642 --> 00:07:03,917
zey hobn zey gefirt do aher nokh Yisroel, iz er iz haynt in Yisroel dos zelbe.

157
00:07:03,917 --> 00:07:07,179
er voynt in, in BE'ER-SHEVA voynt er.

158
00:07:06,325 --> 00:07:07,179
yo

159
00:07:07,708 --> 00:07:09,676
ALSO kh'hob im shoyn nisht getrofn.

160
00:07:09,818 --> 00:07:12,124
zog ikh "hob gemeynt er iz do",

161
00:07:12,214 --> 00:07:15,127
vel ikh z- ⟨zen im⟩ oykhet tsu nemen.

162
00:07:15,353 --> 00:07:19,028
ALSO ikh bin geforn nokh Varshe, ikh kum nokh Varshe,

163
00:07:19,028 --> 00:07:22,046
freg ikh mikh ⟨tsutsien⟩ tsu rov KAHANE,

164
00:07:22,305 --> 00:07:24,802
hot geven in di, in di

165
00:07:24,806 --> 00:07:26,654
aleyen hot er gevoynt.

166
00:07:26,654 --> 00:07:32,507
in di aleyen ober vos er iz geven bavakhtn, ⟨hot⟩ azoy fil vakh, azoy fil zelner zenen geshtanen.

167
00:07:32,507 --> 00:07:35,619
kh'bin tsugekumen, zey hobn mikh ongekukt vi a meshugene

168
00:07:35,619 --> 00:07:39,936
"vu kumt zi do aher? zi geyt UNK dernentert ⟨aykh⟩ oyf keyn UNK,

169
00:07:39,936 --> 00:07:42,549
vi, vi, s'iz dokh nisht meglekh".

170
00:07:43,635 --> 00:07:47,057
hob ikh gezogt "neyn, ikh muz ⟨mit im⟩ redn, ikh bin gevorn geshikt

171
00:07:47,057 --> 00:07:49,552
un ikh muz ⟨mit im⟩ redn, mitn rav KAHANE".

172
00:07:49,677 --> 00:07:52,933
ALSO nakher kumt eyner arop a zelner zogt er mir

173
00:07:52,933 --> 00:07:55,538
"der rav KAHANE iz krank, er ligt in bet".

174
00:07:55,538 --> 00:08:00,268
zog ikh "ikh vil az me zol mikh aroyflozn, ikh zeyer a, a vikhtike zakh tsu ⟨leydikn⟩".

175
00:08:00,291 --> 00:08:04,219
kh'hob nisht avekgeganen, ikh zog "kh'gey nisht avek, ikh muz zen rav KAHANE".

176
00:08:04,219 --> 00:08:07,645
shtelt aykh for, ⟨az me hot⟩ mikh aroyfgefirt tsum rav KAHANE.

177
00:08:07,645 --> 00:08:09,883
zogt "ikh gey yetst aroys fun bet"

178
00:08:09,883 --> 00:08:11,822
ikh UNK inem bet ikh bin gegangen

179
00:08:11,822 --> 00:08:13,847
vos ikh vil? ikh fartseyl im,

180
00:08:13,847 --> 00:08:15,303
az vi

181
00:08:15,327 --> 00:08:18,156
az vi s'volt geven a kindershpil.

182
00:08:18,448 --> 00:08:21,221
zog ikh "ikh for opnemen di kinder un ikh

183
00:08:21,221 --> 00:08:23,927
ikh vil" zog ikh "az der rov zol mir gebn

184
00:08:24,237 --> 00:08:26,914
a a a a ⟨hilf⟩

185
00:08:26,987 --> 00:08:28,367
⟨hilf⟩ emetsn.

186
00:08:28,367 --> 00:08:30,882
⟨oder⟩ mitshikn emetsn ⟨oder⟩ vos"

187
00:08:30,882 --> 00:08:33,207
er iz geven a groyse perzenlekhkeyt,

188
00:08:34,698 --> 00:08:37,864
zogt er "dos ken ikh nisht, kh'ken dir gebn a briv".

189
00:08:38,327 --> 00:08:40,905
hot mir gegebn a briv, ober der briv,

190
00:08:40,905 --> 00:08:43,382
ver hot zikh gekukt oyf same briv demolt?

191
00:08:45,111 --> 00:08:49,290
sho- kh'hob gezogt UNK a rov hot mir gegebn a briv un er

192
00:08:49,290 --> 00:08:53,050
er mir muz ⟨opgebn⟩ di yidishe kinder ober ver hot demolt gekukt oyf dem.

193
00:08:53,050 --> 00:08:57,267
⟨vos hot⟩ keyner afile nisht gevolt kukn fun der politsey mit ale s'iz nisht geven vikhtik.

194
00:08:57,835 --> 00:08:58,757
shoyn.

195
00:08:58,982 --> 00:09:03,662
un ikh, un ikh hob geshikt in politsey, me hot geshikt politsey, me hot zey

196
00:09:03,662 --> 00:09:05,945
un di politsey hot zi gebrengt,

197
00:09:06,205 --> 00:09:08,072
mit dem SAKOWITSHN,

198
00:09:08,601 --> 00:09:13,147
un shoyn nakher tsu UNK avade far UNK

199
00:09:12,406 --> 00:09:13,843
⟨azoy⟩ dem yingl oykhet gefunen?

200
00:09:13,868 --> 00:09:15,454
nakher bin ikh yo

201
00:09:15,454 --> 00:09:19,867
az zi iz shoyn, zi hot dokh nisht gevolt geyn, UNK ⟨zogt⟩ zi vet nisht geyn.

202
00:09:19,350 --> 00:09:20,846
yo, zi hot shoyn dertseylt.

203
00:09:20,616 --> 00:09:22,545
yo, dos veyst ir dokh shoyn.

204
00:09:22,545 --> 00:09:24,612
zi hot dos UNK shoyn fartseyln,

205
00:09:24,612 --> 00:09:27,926
un zi hot gege- zi vil geyn tsu di politsey hob ikh zi ⟨ibergelozt⟩.

206
00:09:27,926 --> 00:09:31,016
zi zi iz geven bay der politsey mer zikherer vi bay mir,

207
00:09:31,016 --> 00:09:32,440
vi bay di yidn.

208
00:09:32,648 --> 00:09:41,799
iz zi ge- iz zi geblibn bay di politsey un ikh bin geforn nokh a tsveyter shtot arayn. ikh bin dort ahingekumen, vider di zelbe zakh, fartseyl er

209
00:09:41,799 --> 00:09:43,880
do iz do a yidish yingl,

210
00:09:44,190 --> 00:09:46,954
s'kon zayn az s'iz mayn shvester's a kind

211
00:09:46,954 --> 00:09:50,168
un s'ken zayn az s'iz nisht mayn shvester's a kind.

212
00:09:50,173 --> 00:09:52,692
s'iz nisht keyn untersheyd. der iz a yidish yingl

213
00:09:52,692 --> 00:09:55,507
ikh vel im nisht iberlozn bay keyn kristn,

214
00:09:55,564 --> 00:09:57,414
me muz im aroysnemen.

215
00:09:57,994 --> 00:09:59,872
zenen di politsey,

216
00:09:59,872 --> 00:10:02,454
me hot gegebn gelt, zikher hot men gegebn gelt.

217
00:10:02,454 --> 00:10:06,121
ikh hob farkoyft epes vi mayn hoyz, hob ikh gehat a bisl gelt.

218
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:09,017
un me hot geUNK un me hot gebrengt

219
00:10:09,017 --> 00:10:14,272
ober UNK aropgeganen fun der oyto, hob ikh gezogt "dos iz er".

220
00:10:14,717 --> 00:10:16,668
kh'hob im derkent, er iz geven

221
00:10:16,911 --> 00:10:20,664
nisht dos kind vos hot gezolt zayn in yenem elter

222
00:10:20,664 --> 00:10:25,246
iz geven ayngehoykert, aynge- dos ober ikh hob dos ponem derkent.

223
00:10:25,246 --> 00:10:27,218
me hot gezogt un er hot mikh oykh derkent.

224
00:10:27,218 --> 00:10:28,700
zogt er "TO CIOCIA".

225
00:10:29,348 --> 00:10:31,670
ober geyn tsu mir hot er nisht gevolt,

226
00:10:31,670 --> 00:10:37,366
s'iz geven geferlekh, s'iz geven gevald UNK azolkhe, er hot azoy geshrign az der komendant

227
00:10:37,366 --> 00:10:40,189
hot gezogt "vos shraystu? me tut dikh ⟨do⟩ gornisht",

228
00:10:40,189 --> 00:10:46,622
zogt er "ikh shray, vayl di yidn veln mikh yetst nemen tsu far peysekh tsu ⟨brokhn⟩ blut oyf matses.

229
00:10:47,725 --> 00:10:52,286
ikh vil nisht" zogt er "di goyim, zey hobn mikh ⟨geratevet⟩ un ikh vil zayn bay zey".

230
00:10:52,286 --> 00:10:54,379
un ven ikh kuk on dos kind

231
00:10:54,379 --> 00:10:57,472
volt ikh gezogt "⟨vu⟩ er iz dort geven bay dem goy?"

232
00:10:58,103 --> 00:11:00,577
volt mir antshuldikt, er iz geven a parkhevate,

233
00:11:00,735 --> 00:11:04,739
bloyz kretsn zenen geven di fis, mit di hent mit alem,

234
00:11:04,739 --> 00:11:06,281
azoy iz er gekumen, azoy.

235
00:11:06,287 --> 00:11:10,264
ir ERZEHLT der foter UNK vos s'iz shoyn geven gut

236
00:11:10,658 --> 00:11:12,436
dos iz nokh UNK.

237
00:11:12,936 --> 00:11:17,320
er iz geshlofn in shtal, mit di beheymes iz er geshlofn, mit di

238
00:11:17,320 --> 00:11:19,224
khazeyrim iz er geshlofn.

239
00:11:19,264 --> 00:11:25,268
un esn vos hobn im zogt er arayngebrengt a bisl avade, vos iz ibergeblibn fun esn.

240
00:11:25,268 --> 00:11:27,391
bay GOSPODARZ iz er gevezn.

241
00:11:28,545 --> 00:11:30,378
ober gu- far dem

242
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:33,484
hob ikh ⟨mehanedik geleygt⟩, ikh hob im gekusht di fis

243
00:11:36,375 --> 00:11:37,921
vayl ikh hob im gezen,

244
00:11:38,788 --> 00:11:41,296
er hot do- er hot im dokh ibergehaltn.

245
00:11:43,395 --> 00:11:44,283
yo

246
00:11:45,420 --> 00:11:47,810
iz shoyn, hot men im opgenumen

247
00:11:48,053 --> 00:11:52,218
un ikh bin arayn tsurik in der sh- di shti- in di nokh

248
00:11:52,218 --> 00:11:54,392
di di shtot vu zi iz geven.

249
00:11:54,583 --> 00:11:57,177
hot zi zikh shoyn geven a bisl opgekilt

250
00:11:57,177 --> 00:12:04,651
un me hot zi arayngenumen tsu zikh vayl di politsey hot gezogt "s'i- s'iz nishto keyn ander eytse, du konst nisht zayn bay undz, du muzst geyn tsu dayn CIOCIA"

251
00:12:04,928 --> 00:12:11,354
ALSO, mit gutn, mit, ikh hob zi tsugezogt goldene UNK

252
00:12:11,354 --> 00:12:16,543
"kh'vel dir koyfn a pilke, kh'vel dir koy- vos zol ikh dir nisht koyfn, kh'for yetst nokh Varshe,

253
00:12:16,543 --> 00:12:20,129
kh'vel im koyfn shtibelekh" er iz geganen tsvey andere shikh.

254
00:12:20,129 --> 00:12:24,837
er iz geganen ongeton a por shikh dos yingl fun eyn fus.

255
00:12:24,837 --> 00:12:27,653
tsvey shikh fun eyn fus.

256
00:12:27,675 --> 00:12:29,579
fun vanet hot er dos gehat?

257
00:12:29,579 --> 00:12:31,727
zenen geforn nokh CIUCHY,

258
00:12:31,727 --> 00:12:35,411
ir veyst nokh di milkhome ho- hobn zey, di goyim,

259
00:12:35,411 --> 00:12:39,917
a- arumgeforn a- aheymnemen CIUCHYs, CIUCHYs hot geheysn

260
00:12:39,917 --> 00:12:42,373
dos vos di daytshn hobn ibergelozt.

261
00:12:42,373 --> 00:12:44,291
hobn zey dos tsuzamengenumen,

262
00:12:45,158 --> 00:12:48,702
tsuzamen un dos hobn zey farkoyft dos hot geheysn CIUCHY.

263
00:12:48,702 --> 00:12:52,430
hobn zey mir mitgenumen oyf CIUCHY hot es zikh gefunen di tsvey shikh,

264
00:12:52,430 --> 00:12:54,934
hot zi zikh ongeton, azoy iz zi geganen barves.

265
00:12:54,934 --> 00:12:56,610
hot nisht gehat keyn por shikh.

266
00:12:56,633 --> 00:12:58,736
in aza UNK iz UNK gevezn.

267
00:12:59,198 --> 00:13:02,069
dos iz geven farn far JESIEŃ,

268
00:13:02,069 --> 00:13:08,979
far di kontakt- kompanyes, ven der yingl volt geblibn iber di kompanyes, er volt es nisht ibergehaltn.

269
00:13:09,475 --> 00:13:10,447
yo

270
00:13:09,559 --> 00:13:14,432
er iz geven elter fun ir mit tsvey yor, er iz geven mit a kop nideriker fun ir

271
00:13:14,432 --> 00:13:18,263
zi hot khotsh gehat a normal lebn, nisht keyn raykh lebn.

272
00:13:18,263 --> 00:13:22,878
zi iz geven bay oreme kristn ober zi hot gehat dos esn, zi hot nisht gehungert.

273
00:13:22,878 --> 00:13:24,807
er hot mamesh gehungert.

274
00:13:25,084 --> 00:13:26,495
er hot gehungert.

275
00:13:26,923 --> 00:13:30,899
⟨vu⟩ zhe hot ir zikh genumen shpeter fun dortn hot ir ⟨nisht⟩ geforn keyn Daytshland tsurik?

276
00:13:30,332 --> 00:13:34,409
fun dortn bin ikh genumen ⟨zey⟩, geforn nokh Varshe.

277
00:13:34,872 --> 00:13:37,480
ikh hob gehat in Varshe dort a bakante.

278
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:40,302
der zelber vos er hot mir oykh geholfn zi opnemen,

279
00:13:40,302 --> 00:13:43,390
iz ersht gevoynt in Varshe, di froy hot dort gevoynt.

280
00:13:43,390 --> 00:13:47,803
bin ikh geforn dort ahin UNK Varshe iz geven UNK in gantsn.

281
00:13:47,803 --> 00:13:51,853
⟨me iz⟩ gevoyn oyf a, a tsebrokhene dire vos iz geven ayngeshtelt.

282
00:13:51,853 --> 00:13:53,760
ober s'iz nisht geven keyn andere

283
00:13:53,760 --> 00:13:57,329
hot zi mikh dort bin ikh dort geven bay zey a por tog

284
00:13:57,329 --> 00:14:01,156
biz ⟨yo ⟩ ikh hob ⟨im⟩ tsugezogt ikh vel im koyfn a pilke

285
00:14:01,298 --> 00:14:04,461
ob- un arumgelofn Varshe, nisht geven keyn pilkes.

286
00:14:04,461 --> 00:14:06,860
me hot nisht gekent krign beshum oyfn nisht.

287
00:14:06,951 --> 00:14:09,915
hot mir eyne gezogt az kh- oyb kh-

288
00:14:10,528 --> 00:14:13,241
k- in epes koyfn iz in

289
00:14:13,241 --> 00:14:14,926
in PRAGA.

290
00:14:14,950 --> 00:14:19,418
ober der Prager brik iz geven tsebrokhn, UNK gekont kumen nokh Prage.

291
00:14:19,418 --> 00:14:21,620
hob ikh gezogt "vifl s'et kostn?"

292
00:14:21,620 --> 00:14:26,384
⟨azoy⟩ vil ikh az me zol mir koyfn a pilke in Prage vifl s'et kostn.

293
00:14:26,408 --> 00:14:28,849
ALSO me hot mir gebrengt aza pilke.

294
00:14:29,361 --> 00:14:31,160
di simkhe geven

295
00:14:32,095 --> 00:14:37,911
groys, shoyn, zey hobn gevolt di pilke, hobn zey gehat di pilke. nakher vos ikh hob gevolt koyfn di shtibelekh,

296
00:14:38,018 --> 00:14:40,880
s'iz nisht geven meglekh tsu krign, ikh hob zey nisht gekoyft.

297
00:14:41,275 --> 00:14:45,861
iz iz un z- zey zenen geven broygez mit mir, beyde hobn nisht geredt.

298
00:14:45,861 --> 00:14:48,643
zey beyde hobn zikh shoyn tsuzamengeredt.

299
00:14:49,645 --> 00:14:51,227
der bruder mit di shvester

300
00:14:51,227 --> 00:14:54,904
ober mit mir zenen zey geven broygez, mit mir hot men nisht geredt.

301
00:14:56,682 --> 00:14:58,363
mamesh nisht geredt.

302
00:14:58,487 --> 00:15:01,619
alts azoy un ⟨nokh iz men⟩ tsugeforn nokh Daytshland.

303
00:15:01,626 --> 00:15:03,859
iz men geforn nokh Daytshland,

304
00:15:03,859 --> 00:15:06,649
iz men gekumen ⟨vi⟩, neyn! nokh Estraykh,

305
00:15:07,060 --> 00:15:09,177
m'iz geforn shoyn nisht UNK nokh Daytshland,

306
00:15:09,177 --> 00:15:12,468
me hot nisht gekont forn nokh Daytsh- hot men geforn nokh Estraykh.

307
00:15:12,468 --> 00:15:14,642
iz men gekumen nokh Estraykh,

308
00:15:14,642 --> 00:15:16,841
iz men gekumen in a lager arayn,

309
00:15:16,881 --> 00:15:18,849
in a yidishn lager,

310
00:15:19,885 --> 00:15:21,938
vi hot geheysn di lage-

311
00:15:24,424 --> 00:15:25,599
keyn UNK nisht.

312
00:15:25,926 --> 00:15:28,513
iz men geven in Estraykh in a lager

313
00:15:28,513 --> 00:15:30,071
un dort hob ikh ⟨im⟩

314
00:15:30,229 --> 00:15:34,841
iz geven shoyn yidn fun Poyln vos zenen gekumen fun Lodzh,

315
00:15:34,841 --> 00:15:37,108
m'iz gekumen biz tsu di grenets.

316
00:15:37,198 --> 00:15:40,753
un ⟨me hot⟩ oykh nisht gekent adurkh di grenets iz nisht geven azoy laykht.

317
00:15:40,753 --> 00:15:45,012
un ikh s'i- ikh bin geven shtark mid, hob ikh zikh anidergeleygt ⟨un⟩ di kinder

318
00:15:45,012 --> 00:15:48,093
un genumen di pilkes hobn zey zikh geshpilt far di tir.

319
00:15:48,150 --> 00:15:51,789
⟨un dem⟩ her ikh me kumt tsu loyfn un me vekt mikh.

320
00:15:51,998 --> 00:15:54,259
kumt tsu tsu mir a froy, vekt mikh

321
00:15:54,259 --> 00:15:57,006
"GEVERET" GEVERT, demolt hot men nisht gezogt GEVERET,

322
00:15:57,006 --> 00:15:58,613
"froy tsu shlofn?

323
00:15:58,613 --> 00:16:03,022
me g- ⟨geyt⟩ zikh dokh di tsaytn, geyt dokh ⟨az m'et⟩ aribergeyn di grenets, me kumt dokh undz nemen"

324
00:16:03,022 --> 00:16:05,291
hob ikh mikh oyfgekhapt ⟨fun⟩ di ban

325
00:16:05,291 --> 00:16:09,012
un ikh bin gelofn arop "di kinder" zog ikh "vu zenen di kinder?"

326
00:16:09,012 --> 00:16:11,253
di kinder, gekhapt di kinder

327
00:16:11,253 --> 00:16:16,253
iz men gelofn mit di f- mit di mentshn ariber di grenets, m'iz adurkh di grenets.

328
00:16:16,028 --> 00:16:17,085
⟨in⟩ Daytshland

329
00:16:17,082 --> 00:16:18,300
nokh Estraykh,

330
00:16:18,340 --> 00:16:21,335
nokh Estraykh, fun Poyln dos iz geven ⟨biz⟩ Estraykh

331
00:16:20,341 --> 00:16:22,132
ah fun Poyln, fun ⟨Estraykh⟩.

332
00:16:21,632 --> 00:16:24,622
un di grenets, m'iz arayn nokh Estraykh,

333
00:16:24,622 --> 00:16:28,579
m'iz arayn in dem lager, in dem lager iz geven nokh yidn.

334
00:16:28,579 --> 00:16:31,895
a un me hot undz opgegebn a plats,

335
00:16:31,895 --> 00:16:34,822
ikh mit di kinder, ikh bin geshlofn mit ⟨der⟩ meydele

336
00:16:34,822 --> 00:16:38,111
un er iz geshlofn mit a an andern, mit a yingl.

337
00:16:38,168 --> 00:16:40,807
shoyn, s'iz s'iz geven an alter yid

338
00:16:40,807 --> 00:16:44,746
vos hot gelernt ⟨mit zey⟩ hob ikh ⟨im⟩ bald arayngege- er zol lernen.

339
00:16:44,746 --> 00:16:48,826
hot der yid tsu mir gekumen a vokh, tsvey kumt er tsu geyn tsu mir.

340
00:16:49,002 --> 00:16:50,312
zogt er

341
00:16:51,617 --> 00:16:55,188
"froy UNK dos yingele hot a molt gelernt yidish?"

342
00:16:55,212 --> 00:16:59,409
zog ikh "ikh veys er iz alt geven di milkhome hot zikh ongehoybn fir yor,

343
00:16:59,409 --> 00:17:01,233
iz er shoyn geganen ⟨in a⟩ kheyder.

344
00:17:01,233 --> 00:17:04,295
fir yor geyt men, UNK dray yor in kheyder".

345
00:17:04,295 --> 00:17:07,484
zog ikh, makht er "vos kh'zog nisht zogt er er veyst,

346
00:17:07,484 --> 00:17:09,600
er ken zogt er a bisl lernen,

347
00:17:09,858 --> 00:17:11,691
er ken a bisl ivre,

348
00:17:11,732 --> 00:17:13,214
er hot zikh dermant".

349
00:17:13,214 --> 00:17:15,624
er hot gekont, der kop iz zeyer gut

350
00:17:15,916 --> 00:17:17,997
ALSO er hot zikh dermant

351
00:17:17,997 --> 00:17:22,967
ober vos, er hot ⟨dokh⟩ nisht gekont redn keyn yidish, ⟨zey hobn UNK⟩ geredt poylish un meyle hot er

352
00:17:22,967 --> 00:17:25,732
mitn poylish, ale hobn dokh farshtanen poylish.

353
00:17:25,958 --> 00:17:27,743
me hot mit im gelernt

354
00:17:27,743 --> 00:17:30,390
ober vos iz geven, s'iz gekumen fraytik,

355
00:17:30,497 --> 00:17:31,928
hob ikh gevolt UNK

356
00:17:31,928 --> 00:17:34,515
kumen yo, un bald hob ikh zi gekoyft

357
00:17:34,515 --> 00:17:37,612
azoy ikh bin gekumen ⟨hob ikh zi⟩ bald veys nisht ⟨vu⟩ UNK

358
00:17:37,703 --> 00:17:39,975
un vi ikh hob zi gekoyft shtibelekh

359
00:17:41,398 --> 00:17:42,691
ho- beyde.

360
00:17:42,816 --> 00:17:45,150
hob ikh gezogt fraytik

361
00:17:45,150 --> 00:17:47,636
er iz a UNK ⟨muz⟩ ikh veys vos

362
00:17:47,862 --> 00:17:51,231
"⟨nem puts dir ot di shtibele⟩ oyf shabes", makht er

363
00:17:51,253 --> 00:17:54,735
"vos far a shabes iz bay mir, far mir iz nishto keyn shabes

364
00:17:54,735 --> 00:17:57,120
ikh vel mir putsn shtibl oyf zuntik".

365
00:17:57,295 --> 00:18:00,394
putst er oyf zuntik, m'iz me hot UNK

366
00:18:00,450 --> 00:18:03,010
krign, zogt er "bay mir iz nishto".

367
00:18:03,010 --> 00:18:05,510
makht er "vos hot ets broykht a shabes?

368
00:18:05,510 --> 00:18:07,239
zibetsik felker

369
00:18:07,239 --> 00:18:09,871
hobn" zogt er "nisht ongenumen dem shabes

370
00:18:09,871 --> 00:18:13,553
muz ikh" zogt er "onnemen, UNK zol ikh onnemen dem shabes?

371
00:18:13,553 --> 00:18:16,547
nishto bay mir keyn shabes".

372
00:18:16,547 --> 00:18:18,281
iz shoyn, iz nisht.

373
00:18:18,523 --> 00:18:21,065
er geyt nisht tsu shul arayn, iz nisht.

374
00:18:21,223 --> 00:18:23,793
ALSO, er iz geganen in di shul arayn,

375
00:18:23,793 --> 00:18:27,523
er hot ongehoybn tsu putsn zikh di shtibl, hot ongehoybn tsu

376
00:18:27,523 --> 00:18:28,561
lernen,

377
00:18:28,561 --> 00:18:32,541
er iz gevorn UNK mentshn biz m'iz gekumen nokh Daytshland.

378
00:18:32,715 --> 00:18:35,898
nokh Daytshland mitn poylish UNK hot er nisht gevolt oystun.

379
00:18:36,124 --> 00:18:38,053
ikh hob gevolt UNK.

380
00:18:38,053 --> 00:18:42,176
nakher hot men shoyn gekumen nokh Daytshland, ⟨m'iz⟩ geven a por khadoshim in Estraykh.

381
00:18:42,452 --> 00:18:46,935
s'iz s'iz geven Estraykh iz oykhet mit esn iz geven zeyer shvakh.

382
00:18:46,941 --> 00:18:47,984
shvakh.

383
00:18:47,984 --> 00:18:50,356
nor vos iz geven

384
00:18:50,356 --> 00:18:53,765
di kinder hob ikh nisht gevolt zoln hungern,

385
00:18:53,765 --> 00:18:56,574
iz azoy az me hot mir gegebn di portsye broyt,

386
00:18:56,574 --> 00:18:58,530
hob ikh avekgeleygt far di kinder.

387
00:18:58,530 --> 00:18:59,607
ikh hob gehat dort

388
00:19:00,812 --> 00:19:02,825
bakante, hobn zey gebrengt ⟨tsi⟩

389
00:19:02,825 --> 00:19:04,276
kartofl,

390
00:19:04,276 --> 00:19:07,627
hobn zey mir gegebn a bisl kartofl, azoy zey hobn gezen az ikh

391
00:19:07,627 --> 00:19:11,739
ganve arop dos broyt un ikh es es nisht, ikh hob nisht far zikh keyn shtikl broyt,

392
00:19:11,739 --> 00:19:15,639
kh'hob zey gegebn, kh'hob gevolt zoln nisht hungern, vayl

393
00:19:15,749 --> 00:19:20,240
z- do hobn zey dokh bay di goyim gegesn, do hobn zey shoyn oyfhern e-

394
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:22,156
s'iz dokh bald geven der UNK.

395
00:19:22,156 --> 00:19:27,724
iz shoyn, ALSO azoy es hot gedoyert azoy di por monatn, m'iz adurkh un m'iz arayn.

396
00:19:27,724 --> 00:19:33,120
kh'bin ahin tsu mayn shvoger, ⟨hot men⟩ gekumen tsu shvoger, hot men shoyn dort gehat a dire oykhet.

397
00:19:33,120 --> 00:19:35,934
di shvoger hot mir dort dos geshikt UNK ⟨s'iz⟩ gevezn

398
00:19:35,934 --> 00:19:37,225
aza lager

399
00:19:37,225 --> 00:19:41,120
fun gefangene iz geven dort in di tsayt fun der milkhome

400
